WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.121 --> 00:00:02.756
- I like to scream, "Puerto
Rico!" and that's about it.

00:00:02.756 --> 00:00:07.205
(techno music)

00:00:09.001 --> 00:00:11.474
- I'm expecting beans and rice.

00:00:11.474 --> 00:00:13.131
- Since it's a U.S. territory,

00:00:13.131 --> 00:00:15.259
I think it might be very American.

00:00:15.259 --> 00:00:16.816
- I'm anticipating a lot of spice.

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:17.967
- Oh, I never thought about it.

00:00:17.967 --> 00:00:19.276
Is it gonna be spicy?

00:00:19.276 --> 00:00:20.772
It's gonna be crazy.

00:00:24.361 --> 00:00:26.452
- Looks like a cracker of some kind with--

00:00:26.452 --> 00:00:29.004
- with jelly on it
- frozen jelly.

00:00:29.004 --> 00:00:30.803
- This is guava and this is a cracker.

00:00:34.203 --> 00:00:35.436
- So the first thing
tastes bland to me but

00:00:35.436 --> 00:00:37.363
it tastes so good with the fruity thing.

00:00:37.363 --> 00:00:40.000
- It's got like this sweet salty combo.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.329
- (mumbles) This is really good.

00:00:41.329 --> 00:00:42.799
- This is what I would
eat when I was a kid

00:00:42.799 --> 00:00:44.088
and my mom just wanted me to shut up.

00:00:44.088 --> 00:00:45.594
She would give me stuff like this.

00:00:48.722 --> 00:00:51.717
- Mmm!
- Yes, yes, okay.

00:00:53.617 --> 00:00:56.105
- Oh man! This is like fried potato

00:00:56.105 --> 00:00:57.135
with meat inside of it!

00:00:57.135 --> 00:00:58.667
- Wow!
- Wow.

00:00:58.667 --> 00:00:59.734
- Can we get this for lunch?

00:00:59.734 --> 00:01:01.013
- Yeah, this is fantastic.

00:01:01.013 --> 00:01:02.429
- The potato's kinda thicker.

00:01:02.429 --> 00:01:03.857
- It'a a lot of potato for me.

00:01:03.857 --> 00:01:04.891
- I recommend that.

00:01:04.891 --> 00:01:06.521
- I would eat this.

00:01:09.115 --> 00:01:11.589
- This looks like raisins,
which makes me very nervous.

00:01:11.589 --> 00:01:14.352
- No, they're little black
beans with yellow rice.

00:01:17.002 --> 00:01:17.963
- Mmm, it's good!

00:01:17.963 --> 00:01:19.456
It's not as spicy as
I thought it would be.

00:01:19.456 --> 00:01:20.993
- It's almost like you're questioning

00:01:20.993 --> 00:01:22.586
if there is even a hint of spice.

00:01:22.586 --> 00:01:24.049
- It's a little oily for my taste.

00:01:24.049 --> 00:01:25.163
- I don't mind it.

00:01:25.163 --> 00:01:26.811
- I would put some salt on this.

00:01:30.201 --> 00:01:32.221
- (both) Mofongo!

00:01:32.221 --> 00:01:33.786
- What did you just call me?

00:01:33.786 --> 00:01:36.297
- That sounds like an
elephant in a Disney movie.

00:01:38.317 --> 00:01:39.710
- I really like the pork.

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:41.289
The plantain is really dry.

00:01:41.289 --> 00:01:43.169
- The pork is very subtle, it's not like

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:45.931
overpoweringly like what we're used to.

00:01:45.931 --> 00:01:47.523
- This could use some salt.

00:01:47.523 --> 00:01:49.751
- This is so good I'm gonna
name my first child Mofongo.

00:01:49.751 --> 00:01:51.226
- (both) Mofongo!

00:01:57.666 --> 00:01:59.480
- It smells like a Krispy Kreme doughnut.

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:01.362
- It kinda does smell like a churro.

00:02:01.362 --> 00:02:02.927
I'm gonna drink the whole thing.

00:02:04.327 --> 00:02:05.846
- Whoo! That was great!

00:02:05.846 --> 00:02:07.285
- I would definitely
think there's rum in here,

00:02:07.285 --> 00:02:08.783
cause it's a creamy drink.

00:02:08.783 --> 00:02:10.141
- It's really bland.

00:02:10.141 --> 00:02:11.626
- Yeah, the coconut taste, it's just,

00:02:11.626 --> 00:02:12.816
too much, too much coconut.

00:02:12.826 --> 00:02:14.599
- Like, just enough cinnamon, too.

00:02:14.599 --> 00:02:16.492
- So this is only served during Christmas?

00:02:16.492 --> 00:02:17.874
- This is actually good.

00:02:17.874 --> 00:02:19.557
We need to replace eggnog with this.

00:02:19.557 --> 00:02:21.460
- I would go to Puerto Rico just for this.

00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:22.912
- You've impressed me, Puerto Rico,

00:02:22.912 --> 00:02:23.818
you have impressed me.

00:02:23.818 --> 00:02:26.240
- I have been impressed by the mofongo.

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:27.994
- I loved it. It was great.

00:02:27.994 --> 00:02:31.881
- (both) Puerto Rico!
Puerto Rico! Puerto Rico!

